# Code owners. With "Require review from Code Owners" on main, every change
# needs an approval from an owner of each path it touches.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so a stricter rule below replaces the
# default owners for its paths rather than adding to them. An owner must be a
# user or a visible team with write access to this repository; a rule whose
# owners are all invalid is dropped, leaving its paths unowned. Check
# `gh api repos/bluesky-social/diderot/codeowners/errors` after any edit.

# Everything: any Bluesky platform engineer.
*                               @sarahmaeve @bluesky-social/platform

